message: "If you use zotLook, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: zotLook
abstract: >-
  A Zotero plugin that previews attachments with the operating system's
  Quick Look (macOS), GNOME Sushi (Linux) or QuickLook (Windows) when you
  press Space. Derived from Guillaume Chapron's Zotero7QuickLook.
type: software
